{"id":"st2048-1","designation":"ST 2048-1","title":"Digital Cinematography Product Image Format FS/709 — 2048 × 1080 and 4096 × 2160 Digital Cinematography Production Image Formats FS/709","state":"active","suite":"2048","official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2048-1/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2048-1/","checked_at":"2026-11-11"},"scope":"This standard defines a family of progressive sample structures of 2048 × 1080 and 4096 × 2160 images for D-Cinema content creation as defined in Table 1 and Table 2 in Clause 5. This standard specifies: • R′G′B′ color encoding and digital representation1 • Y′C′BC′R color encoding and digital representation • R′FSG′FSB′FS color encoding and digital representation This standard also defines tristimulus values and reference white of Free Scale-Gamut (FS-Gamut), Free Scale-Log (FS-Log) curve and a Color VANC packet. The FS-Log curve has an affinity with the sensitivity of human eye and can specify a much wider dynamic range than the nonlinear curve defined in Recommendation ITU-R BT.709. The Color VANC carries tristimulus values, reference white and parameter values of the FS-Log curve. An auxiliary component “A” may optionally accompany R′G′B′, Y′C′BC′R and R′FSG′FSB′FS; these interfaces are denoted R′G′B′A, Y′C′BC′RA and R′FSG′FSB′FSA. The “A” component if present, shall have the same characteristics as the G′, Y′ or G′FS channel. Sampling structures supported by this standard include, 4:4:4:4, 4:4:4, and 4:2:2. NOTE FS-Gamut and FS-Log are identifying names of the defined color space and the Log curve in this standard.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"Foreword","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"Intellectual Property","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"Introduction","page":2},{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"4 General","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"5 Image Pixel Array and Mapping","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"6 System Colorimetry","page":7},{"level":1,"title":"7 Pixel Array Representation","page":20},{"level":1,"title":"Annex A (Informative) Conversion between FS-Gamut Primaries and ITU-R BT.709, CIE XYZ","page":21},{"level":1,"title":"Annex B (Informative) Flow Chart to Select Nonlinear Curve and Upper and Lower Three Coordinates of FS-Log Curve","page":22},{"level":1,"title":"Annex C (Informative) Document Roadmap","page":23},{"level":1,"title":"Bibliography (Informative)","page":24}],"definitions":[],"keywords":[{"term":"Chromaticity","zh":"色度","abbr":"","category":"measurement","source":"curated"},{"term":"Transfer Function","zh":"传递函数","abbr":"","category":"measurement","source":"curated"},{"term":"Digital Cinema Distribution Master","zh":"数字影院发行母版","abbr":"DCDM","category":"cinema","source":"curated"},{"term":"VANC","zh":"","abbr":"VANC","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"DID","zh":"","abbr":"DID","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"CIE","zh":"","abbr":"CIE","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"SDID","zh":"","abbr":"SDID","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"UDW","zh":"","abbr":"UDW","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"FSB","zh":"","abbr":"FSB","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"FSG","zh":"","abbr":"FSG","category":"other","source":"acronym"}],"refs":[{"id":"st274","designation":"ST 274"},{"id":"st291-1","designation":"ST 291-1"},{"id":"rp177","designation":"RP 177"},{"id":"eg2111-1","designation":"EG 2111-1"},{"id":"eg2111-2","designation":"EG 2111-2"},{"id":"eg2111-3","designation":"EG 2111-3"}],"cited_by":[{"id":"ov2048-0","designation":"OV 2048-0"},{"id":"ov2081-0","designation":"OV 2081-0"},{"id":"ov2082-0","designation":"OV 2082-0"},{"id":"ov292-0","designation":"OV 292-0"},{"id":"ov425-0","designation":"OV 425-0"},{"id":"rdd40","designation":"RDD 40"},{"id":"rp219-2","designation":"RP 219-2"},{"id":"st12-2","designation":"ST 12-2"},{"id":"st2048-2","desig